<!-- Ring Size Guide Page (Exact Match to diamondsforeveryone.com.au) -->
<div class="rsg-page-wrapper">

  <!-- =========================================================================
       SECTION 0: HEADER INTRO
       ========================================================================= -->
  <section class="rsg-header-section">
    <div class="rsg-container">
      <div class="rsg-header-box" data-aos="fade-up">
        <span class="rsg-subtag">RING SIZE GUIDE</span>
        <h1 class="rsg-main-title">Find Your Perfect Ring Size with HB Prestige Jewels</h1>
        <p class="rsg-intro-text">
          Choosing the correct ring size is essential for comfort, security, and peace of mind, especially when buying a ring online. This comprehensive ring size guide will help you measure accurately from home using trusted and easy methods.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =========================================================================
       SECTION 1: WHY RING SIZE MATTERS (SPLIT)
       ========================================================================= -->
  <section class="rsg-split-section">
    <div class="rsg-container">
      <div class="rsg-split-grid">
        <div class="rsg-split-content" data-aos="fade-right">
          <h2 class="rsg-section-title">Why Ring Size Matters</h2>
          <p class="rsg-desc">
            A ring that fits properly should feel comfortable throughout the day and stay securely in place on your finger. It should not spin, slide around, or cause any pressure or irritation.
          </p>
          <p class="rsg-desc">
            Choosing the correct size from the beginning also helps avoid the inconvenience of resizing later, making the buying experience smoother and more worry-free.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rsg-split-media" data-aos="fade-left">
          <div class="rsg-img-frame">
            <img
              src="https://diamondsforeveryone.com.au/cdn/shop/files/COUPLE-IMAGE-WITH-RING_jpg.webp?v=1775217861&width=1066"
              alt="Couple with Diamond Ring"
              loading="lazy"
              class="rsg-img"
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =========================================================================
       SECTION 2: RING SIZES EXPLAINED (SPLIT REVERSED)
       ========================================================================= -->
  <section class="rsg-split-section rsg-split-section--alt">
    <div class="rsg-container">
      <div class="rsg-split-grid rsg-split-grid--reversed">
        <div class="rsg-split-media" data-aos="fade-right">
          <div class="rsg-img-frame">
            <img
              src="https://diamondsforeveryone.com.au/cdn/shop/files/engagement_D1r3QVP2_jpg.webp?v=1775217861&width=1066"
              alt="Engagement Ring Fit & Sizing"
              loading="lazy"
              class="rsg-img"
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rsg-split-content" data-aos="fade-left">
          <h2 class="rsg-section-title">Ring Sizes Explained</h2>
          <p class="rsg-desc">
            Standard ring sizes are measured either by alphabetical sizing (UK / Australia A to Z) or numerical US sizing (US 3 to 14) along with precise millimetre measurements.
          </p>
          <ul class="rsg-bullet-list">
            <li><strong>Most common women’s ring sizes</strong> range from US 5 to 7 (AU L to N)</li>
            <li><strong>Most common men’s ring sizes</strong> range from US 9 to 11 (AU T to W)</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="rsg-desc">
            All rings from HB Prestige Jewels are custom-crafted to your exact selected ring size for a flawless, secure fit.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =========================================================================
       SECTION 3: HOW TO FIND YOUR RING SIZE (SPLIT)
       ========================================================================= -->
  <section class="rsg-split-section">
    <div class="rsg-container">
      <div class="rsg-split-grid">
        <div class="rsg-split-content" data-aos="fade-right">
          <h2 class="rsg-section-title">How to Find Your Ring Size</h2>
          <p class="rsg-desc">
            Finding your ring size at home is simple and does not require special tools. With a few easy methods, you can measure accurately and choose a size that feels comfortable and secure for everyday wear.
          </p>
          <ul class="rsg-bullet-list">
            <li><strong>Measure an existing ring</strong> that fits the intended finger using its inside diameter.</li>
            <li><strong>Use an accurate conversion chart</strong> to find your exact US or international size.</li>
            <li><strong>Measure your finger</strong> with a paper strip or ring sizer tape if you do not have a ring.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="rsg-tip-box">
            <strong>Pro Tip:</strong> For the most accurate fit, measure at the end of the day when fingers are at their normal size, and avoid measuring when hands are cold.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rsg-split-media" data-aos="fade-left">
          <div class="rsg-img-frame">
            <img
              src="https://diamondsforeveryone.com.au/cdn/shop/files/ring_size2.png?v=1771631284&width=1066"
              alt="Inside Diameter Ring Sizing Chart"
              loading="lazy"
              class="rsg-img"
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =========================================================================
       SECTION 4 & 5: INTERNATIONAL RING SIZE CHART
       ========================================================================= -->
